$$\frac{\partial^2 u}{\partial y^2} = \frac{\partial}{\partial y}(\arctan \frac{y}{x}) = -\frac{1}{1 + (\frac{y}{x})^2} \cdot \frac{y}{x^2 + y^2}$$

